TaxCalc<span class=\"gradient-text\">.com</span></span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Precision tax calculators for 2026. Compute your take-home pay, plan your mortgage, and compare state taxes — all free, all accurate.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg>2026 Tax Data</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-muted/30 px-2.5 py-1\">Secure &amp; Private</span></div></div><div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\">Calculators</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-border/50 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-400 hover:decoration-emerald-400\" href=\"/paycheck-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg>Paycheck Calculator</a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-border/50 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-400 hover:decoration-emerald-400\" href=\"/illinois-tax-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Illinois Tax</a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-border/50 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-400 hover:decoration-emerald-400\" href=\"/texas-tax-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Texas Tax</a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-border/50 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-400 hover:decoration-emerald-400\" href=\"/florida-tax-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Florida Tax</a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-border/50 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-400 hover:decoration-emerald-40